    "sclc_jhu"
  ],
  "description": "Whole exome-sequencing of 80 human SCLCs, including 36 primary SCLC human tumor and adjacent normal sample pairs and 17 paired SCLC cell lines and their patient-matched lymphoblastoid lines, as well as 4 primary SCLC tumors and 23 SCLC cell lines without matched normal controls. Data from Rudin et al., Nat Gene 2012. Sequencing data are publicly available in EGA (EGAS0000100334)",
